==Trivia==
*During the original Japanese run of this event, the limits on the Featured Items did not work correctly. This meant that players could amass many Platinum Shards, resulting in the swift removal of the Event Gacha. It returned 1 week later with the bug fixed. 1 Legendary Spirit, 1 Cat Ticket and 1 Rare Ticket were given as compensation.
*During the 2025 English run of this event, the drop rates for the Featured Items were incredibly low. The drop rates were fixed on November 6th. Players were given A Legendary Spirit, 3 Leaderships and 1 Rare Ticket as compensation.

